{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgaHFbRQqsEtHHQAbKfCh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can't answer that from the data I have. The GetHookd ad library only uses impressions to rank ads within a single brand. It has no impression, spend or performance figures you can compare across brands, so I can't name which pet supplies brand gets the most impressions.\n\nHere's what I can do in the pet supplies niche instead:\n\n- **Count ads per brand:** list the brands running the most ads (active or overall). This shows how much each brand advertises, not how many people see the ads.\n- **Top ads for a brand:** for any brand you name, find its highest-impression ads.\n- **Long-running ads:** find ads that have been live a long time, which often means they're performing well.\n\nIf you need real cross-brand impression numbers, you'd have to use a tool with reach or spend estimates. Meta's Ad Library only shows reach for EU-targeted ads; otherwise you'd need a paid ad intelligence platform.\n\nShould I run one of these?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12549,"cache_read_input_tokens":10873,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12549},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"750b7806-2edb-4d35-89f0-b77dd8703d07","uuid":"10c621c0-5657-45b5-a113-47ee55bd558e","timestamp":"2026-10-31T12:02:42.309Z","request_id":"req_011CgaHFaqhEn7rXKZBpkhbr"}
